        "name": "Stephanie Bednarek",
        "text": "We're now connecting millions of people in Bangladesh with Starlink Mobile! Our technology provides an additional layer of connectivity in cellular dead zones so coastal communities, remote businesses, families and travelers can stay in touch no matter where they are.",
